        "left-sided lacrimal sac abscess with postseptal fat stranding on CT",
        " cultures isolated pan-susceptible Streptococcus pyogenes"
      ],
      "excluded_candidates": [
        "Dry eye syndrome: less likely due to presence of lacrimal sac abscess and orbital pain",
